5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Since we need to decide on a destination before bookings open, let's figure out what we need to know first. I'll look into the group transport receipts and the quoting terms for whole-building lets.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I think it would be lovely to see what the seniors say about year-groups mixing, and I'll also check the attendance sheets for the away camps.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I will examine the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, as well as the lottery and application process for public group bookings.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know about the accounts from the clubs that went inland and the prefecture rate sheet for the beds!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll check the vacation timetable for the club's own hall and the membership list against first-train times.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Does anyone else think we should check the cooking duty? @Ryuji, you're on it, but I wonder if that affects the cost too. I'm set on my two choices for now.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a thoughtful point, Mio. I believe the atmosphere of the evenings is just as important as the cost, but I am happy with my choices.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, the cooking duty is more about the burden on the organizers than the budget. I'll report back on how much time it actually takes.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm curious if the public beds are actually comfortable! I'll stick with the inland accounts and the rate sheet to see if it's a good deal.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree with Ryuji. I'll stick with the hall timetable and the train times to see if staying local is even feasible for everyone.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I think we've covered the main bases. I'll stick with the transport receipts and the building let terms to see how the money flows.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I believe we have a very balanced approach. I will remain with the seniors' perspectives and the attendance records to ensure everyone feels included.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'm satisfied with the current distribution of tasks. I'll proceed with the canteen and lottery details to assess the administrative load.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm all set too! I'll find out if those inland places are actually fun or just a big sleep-deprivation trap.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll stay with the hall timetable and the train times. It's important to know if the logistics work before we commit to a location.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm ready to start digging into these records. Let's meet back here once we've all found our answers!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I look forward to hearing what everyone discovers. Let us all do our best for the sake of the club.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will begin my research now. I'll be sure to provide a clear summary of the administrative requirements and the cooking situation.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm going to find out everything about those inland beds! See you all soon!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll get started on the logistics. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
