60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Now that we've weighed everything, I'm voting for Option C, the Coastal Lodge. It's the best for bonding, and we can handle the headcount risk with Shizue's idea.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,I also vote for Option C. It provides the best environment for our members to truly connect and grow closer as a club.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,I vote for Option C. It avoids the administrative burden of the public system and the logistical failures of the campus option.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option C for me too! Let's go to the beach and have a camp where we can actually sleep and have fun!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'll vote for Option C as well. While the financial risk is concerning, it's the only choice that doesn't compromise our training or our sanity.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
